<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="color-scheme" content="dark">
  <title>NPMplus on Umbrel</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      color-scheme: dark;
      font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
      background: #080b12;
      color: #f4f7fb;
    }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      min-height: 100vh;
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 15% 0%, rgba(79, 70, 229, .3), transparent 32rem),
        radial-gradient(circle at 90% 20%, rgba(14, 165, 233, .18), transparent 26rem),
        #080b12;
    }
    main { width: min(1040px, calc(100% - 32px)); margin: 0 auto; padding: 52px 0 72px; }
    header { display: flex; gap: 22px; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 28px; }
    .mark {
      display: grid; place-items: center; flex: 0 0 72px; height: 72px;
      border-radius: 22px; background: linear-gradient(145deg, #6157ff, #249be8);
      box-shadow: 0 16px 48px rgba(58, 89, 240, .35); font-size: 34px; font-weight: 800;
    }
    h1 { margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: clamp(30px, 6vw, 48px); letter-spacing: -.04em; }
    header p { margin: 0; color: #aeb8cb; font-size: 17px; }
    .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(12, 1fr); gap: 18px; }
    .card {
      grid-column: span 6; padding: 24px; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1);
      border-radius: 20px; background: rgba(17, 22, 34, .88); box-shadow: 0 18px 50px rgba(0,0,0,.2);
    }
    .wide { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
    h2 { margin: 0 0 14px; font-size: 20px; letter-spacing: -.02em; }
    p { color: #c5cede; line-height: 1.58; }
    p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
    .actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; margin-top: 20px; }
    .button {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-height: 46px; padding: 0 18px;
      border: 0; border-radius: 12px; background: #5b5cf0; color: white; font: inherit; font-weight: 700;
      text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;
    }
    .button:hover { background: #7071ff; }
    .secondary { background: #222b3d; }
    .secondary:hover { background: #2c374d; }
    code {
      padding: 3px 7px; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1); border-radius: 7px;
      background: #0b101a; color: #dce7ff; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;
    }
    .details { display: grid; grid-template-columns: auto 1fr; gap: 10px 18px; margin: 18px 0 0; }
    .details dt { color: #8f9bb1; }
    .details dd { margin: 0; font-weight: 650; }
    ol { margin: 14px 0 0; padding-left: 22px; color: #c5cede; }
    li { margin: 10px 0; padding-left: 4px; line-height: 1.5; }
    .warning {
      border-color: rgba(250, 204, 21, .28);
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(113, 76, 12, .28), rgba(17, 22, 34, .9));
    }
    .danger {
      border-color: rgba(248, 113, 113, .25);
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(105, 31, 43, .25), rgba(17, 22, 34, .9));
    }
    .small { color: #8f9bb1; font-size: 13px; }
    @media (max-width: 760px) {
      main { padding-top: 30px; }
      header { align-items: flex-start; }
      .mark { flex-basis: 58px; height: 58px; border-radius: 17px; font-size: 27px; }
      .card { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
      .details { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 5px; }
      .details dd { margin-bottom: 8px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main>
    <header>
      <div class="mark">N+</div>
      <div>
        <h1>NPMplus</h1>
        <p>Reverse proxy setup for your Umbrel</p>
      </div>
    </header>

    <section class="grid">
      <article class="card wide">
        <h2>Open the administration interface</h2>
        <p>NPMplus serves its administration interface over HTTPS. The first visit may show a certificate warning because NPMplus starts with a locally generated certificate. Confirm that the address is your Umbrel before continuing.</p>
        <div class="actions">
          <a class="button" id="open-admin" href="https://${DEVICE_DOMAIN_NAME}:${APP_SALTEDLOLLY_NPM_PLUS_ADMIN_PORT}" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Open NPMplus</a>
          <button class="button secondary" id="copy-admin" type="button">Copy address</button>
        </div>
        <dl class="details">
          <dt>Administration URL</dt>
          <dd><code id="admin-address">https://${DEVICE_DOMAIN_NAME}:${APP_SALTEDLOLLY_NPM_PLUS_ADMIN_PORT}</code></dd>
          <dt>Initial username</dt>
          <dd><code>admin@umbrel.local</code></dd>
          <dt>Initial password</dt>
          <dd>Open the app's credentials in Umbrel to reveal its unique password.</dd>
        </dl>
      </article>

      <article class="card">
        <h2>1. Point public DNS at your router</h2>
        <p>Create an A record for your domain pointing to your public IPv4 address. Add an AAAA record only if you intentionally expose the service over IPv6 and have configured the corresponding firewall rules.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="card">
        <h2>2. Forward router ports</h2>
        <dl class="details">
          <dt>External TCP 80</dt><dd>Umbrel TCP <code>${APP_SALTEDLOLLY_NPM_PLUS_HTTP_PORT}</code></dd>
          <dt>External TCP 443</dt><dd>Umbrel TCP <code>${APP_SALTEDLOLLY_NPM_PLUS_HTTPS_PORT}</code></dd>
          <dt>External UDP 443</dt><dd>Umbrel UDP <code>${APP_SALTEDLOLLY_NPM_PLUS_HTTPS_PORT}</code></dd>
        </dl>
      </article>

      <article class="card">
        <h2>3. Create a proxy host</h2>
        <ol>
          <li>Sign in to NPMplus and open <strong>Hosts → Proxy Hosts</strong>.</li>
          <li>Enter the public domain and the local hostname or IP address of the service.</li>
          <li>Request a TLS certificate and enable the security options appropriate for that service.</li>
        </ol>
      </article>

      <article class="card warning">
        <h2>Protect anything you publish</h2>
        <p>A valid TLS certificate encrypts traffic but does not replace authentication. Do not expose an Umbrel service unless it has suitable login protection, access controls, and current security updates.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="card danger wide">
        <h2>Existing installation or migration?</h2>
        <p>Do not copy data from Portainer while either NPMplus instance is running. Back up the complete existing <code>/data</code> volume first, test this app as a clean installation, and only then follow the migration procedure. Uninstalling this Umbrel app deletes its persistent app data.</p>
      </article>
    </section>

    <p class="small">NPMplus ${APP_VERSION} · Launcher protected by your Umbrel login</p>
  </main>
  <script>
    (function () {
      var host = window.location.hostname || "${DEVICE_DOMAIN_NAME}";
      var address = "https://" + host + ":${APP_SALTEDLOLLY_NPM_PLUS_ADMIN_PORT}";
      var link = document.getElementById("open-admin");
      var label = document.getElementById("admin-address");
      var copy = document.getElementById("copy-admin");
      link.href = address;
      label.textContent = address;
      copy.addEventListener("click", function () {
        navigator.clipboard.writeText(address).then(function () {
          copy.textContent = "Copied";
          window.setTimeout(function () { copy.textContent = "Copy address"; }, 1600);
        });
      });
    }());
  </script>
</body>
</html>
